This project derives data tables from the Dart SDK source code,
which is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License. Specifically:

- CID (Class ID) tables in internal/snapshot/version.go are derived
  from dart-lang/sdk's runtime/vm/class_id.h
- Thread (THR) field offsets in internal/vmtables/thrfields.go and
  internal/vmtables/thrfieldsx64.go are derived from
  dart-lang/sdk's runtime/runtime_offsets_extracted.h
- Thread stub entry-point names in internal/vmtables/stubnames.go and
  internal/vmtables/threadstubs.go are derived from
  dart-lang/sdk's runtime/vm/stub_code_list.h and runtime_entry_list.h
- Snapshot format constants in internal/snapshot/version.go are derived
  from dart-lang/sdk's runtime/vm/snapshot.h

